  "ruleText": "He-P 2205.03 Occupational and Environmental Health Samples. The following fees shall be charged for those occupational and environmental health samples set forth in Table He-P 2205.03 Occupational and Environmental below:\n\nTable He-P 2205.03 Occupational and Environmental\n\nTEST | FEE\n\nLead, maple syrup | 40.00\n\nSource. #2641, eff 9-5-83; ss by #4000, eff 2-26-86; ss by #4201, eff 1-8-87; ss by #4480, eff 8-31-88; ss by #5029, eff 12-20-90; ss by #5761, eff 1-3-94; eff 1-3-94; ss by #7171, INTERIM, eff 1-4-00, EXPIRED: 5-4-00; ss by #7256, eff 5-3-00; ss by #8891, eff 5-25-07; ss by #10935, INTERIM, eff 9-22-15, EXPIRED: 3-20-16\n\nNew. #11064, eff 4-1-16",
